      "created_at": "2014-12-01T02:46:04.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I would say no. Although an infection is played on a hero, it is not a hero card. It is still a villain card and belongs to the villain. It's kind of like how when you play Wrest the Mind on the Electropulse explosive, the card still belongs to Visionary, and a Sedative Flechettes would destroy it.</p>",
